  msgPrompt: Product not in catalog yet! Tap to take a quick photo for live AI analysis.
  msgConsent: Only if you tap "Take a photo of the product", one photo is sent to
    an AI web search to identify it.
  msgHowTo: Show the front of the pack, or the side with the ingredient list, inside
    the frame. Good light helps.
  idleLabel: Take photo
  busyLabel: Analyzing Packaging...
  coolingLabel: Wait {0} s
  msgNoCamera: The camera is not running. Close this, tap the scan button, then try
    again.
  msgOffline: 'No internet: the photo cannot be read now. Try again when you are
    online, or type the product in.'
  msgNoAi: The AI is not set up on this phone, so the photo cannot be read. Type
    the product in instead.
  msgSignIn: Sign in again to send a photo, or type the product in by hand.
  msgCooldown: Wait {0} seconds before the next photo.
  msgDailyLimit: You have sent {0} photos today. Try again tomorrow, or type the
    product in.
  msgBusy: Photo reading is busy for today. Type the product in by hand, or try again
    tomorrow.
  msgDown: The photo could not be read. Type the product in by hand.
  msgNoWebSources: 'No web sources were found: this reading comes from the photo
    alone.'
  msgNothing: The AI could not read a product in the photo. Try more light, wipe
    the lens, show the front of the pack, or type it in.
  msgNoList: Found {0}, but no ingredient list could be read. Turn the pack to its
    ingredient list and take another photo.
  msgFromYou: 'You already sent this product: its reading is used. It is waiting
    for an admin''s approval.'
